{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204220","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1120422001:0":{"text":"As soon as that letter was buried, I felt so relieved. As if I'd said a proper goodbye...","source_cn":"信埋进土里的瞬间，我感到了放松很多，像是完成了告别……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0BF92E9F86E29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120422002:0":{"text":"I realized why Jackson said he envied me.","source_cn":"我想起来了，贾克松大哥之前为什么会说很羡慕我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47A11724B67E6FB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120422003:0":{"text":"Why not?","source_cn":"为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E7417DCB53E6D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120422004:0":{"text":"When we were sheltering behind a rock to escape that sandstorm, he asked if I thought we were going to die.","source_cn":"当时我们蜷缩在岩壁后面躲避沙暴，他问我，我们是不是要死了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66EFCEE4D920070A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120422005:0":{"text":"I said we wouldn't and that Melissa would cry if I did.","source_cn":"我说：不！要是我死了，梅丽莎一定会哭出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95F65CE4EBFC18FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120422006:0":{"text":"He said it was a blessing to be able to cry.","source_cn":"他说，能流泪，很幸福。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA4507105B1C69D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120422007:0":{"text":"And to have someone cry for you after your death was an even greater blessing...","source_cn":"有死后能为自己流泪的人，是更值得庆幸的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E49041464D2B6C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120422008:0":{"text":"Oh, Jackson...","source_cn":"贾克松大哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA3A8FC992581CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1120422008":{"text":"Oh, Jackson...","source_cn":"贾克松大哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA3A8FC992581CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120422009:0":{"text":"Why am I crying?! We are the rising stars of the Evergreen Conservatory! We've crossed mountains and deserts, and even explored the forbidden mysteries of the gods! How can I...?!","source_cn":"我……我怎么能哭？！我们，冬青学会的双星！跨越了群山和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66A03B8F37084107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120422010:0":{"text":"How can I cry for someone that I just bumped into on the road? Someone I can't even call a friend...","source_cn":"怎么能为一个在路上随随便便碰到的，连朋友都算不上的人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3052DC6A29ADE9F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120422011:0":{"text":"*Crying*...","source_cn":"呜……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA20BFE0AD56F63EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120422012:0":{"text":"Jackson... Thank you for the water...","source_cn":"谢谢你，贾克松大哥，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE97ECD4243EB3550","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120422013:0":{"text":"It's alright, Gali. Cry to your heart's content. May our tears help Jackson's spirit find peace.","source_cn":"没关系的，伽利，痛快地哭吧，用我们的泪水，让贾克松大哥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF81E8C9375FFEA2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"It's okay if you want to cry.","source_cn":"想哭就哭吧","status":"matched_runtim